                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho naijwaho Mwoyo, narora ekitebe ky'obukama kiteekaniziibwe omu iguru, kiikaliirweho omuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Ogu ow'akaba akiikaliireho, akaba naayengeengeta nk'amabaale ag'omuhendo aganyakwetwa yasipi na saarudiyo; kandi ekitebe eki kikaba kyehinguliriziibwe omuhangazima ogurukusisana ibaale ly'omuhendo erinyakwetwa simaragido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe eki kikaba kyehinguliriziibwe ebitebe ebindi makumi abiri na bbina. Kandi ha bitebe ebi hakaba haikaliireho abakuru makumi abiri na bbana, bajwaire ebijwaro ebirukwera, baina ekondo za zaabbu ha mitwe yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
