              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kitebe eky'obukama haarugamu emirabyo erukumulikya, okubbaruka kw'enkuba n'okuhinda. Omumaiso gaakyo hakaba haroho etaara musanju ezirukwaka, ezirukumanyisa emyoyo musanju eya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
